+/// pair is lifted, on a white page, where nothing lighter than the floor is readable,
+/// the dimmer one is darkened. The grays are one family in order: black, bright black,
+/// white, bright white.
+fn readable_basic(palette: [Rgb; 16], page: Rgb, dark: bool) -> [Rgb; 16] {
